<title>ITALY: SPEED SKATING-ITALY SETS 5,000 SHORT TRACK RECORD.</title>
<headline>SPEED SKATING-ITALY SETS 5,000 SHORT TRACK RECORD.</headline>
<dateline>BORMIO, Italy 1997-02-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Italian men set a 5,000</p>
<p>metres relay short track world record of six minutes 59.63</p>
<p>seconds on Sunday in a World Cup speed skating race.</p>
<p>The team of Mirko Vuillermin, Fabio Carta, Michele Antoniolo</p>
<p>and Orazio Fagone sliced almost a second off the previous best</p>
<p>of 7:00.41 set by South Korea.</p>
</text>
